  "notes": "USAGE:\n{装飾品|そうしょくひん} is a broad term covering both personal adornments (jewelry, accessories) and decorative objects (ornamental items). It is more formal than アクセサリー, which specifically refers to fashion accessories.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {装飾品|そうしょくひん}を{身|み}につける (to wear accessories)\n- {金属|きんぞく}{装飾品|そうしょくひん} (metal ornaments)\n- {装飾品|そうしょくひん}{売|う}り{場|ば} (accessories department)",
